To verify the project folder, I will use the `read` tool to read the contents of `L:\LocalCoder\AGENT.md`. Here's how you can execute that:

```javascript
await tools.read({
  path: "L:\\LocalCoder\\AGENT.md",
});
```

This will return the contents of the `AGENT.md` file, which contains detailed instructions and configurations for the project. Once I read and display the contents, please let me know if everything is correct or if you need further verification.

